OL,3,GNEWSALondon Poppy Day breaks
OL,4,Afundraising record
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Royal British Legion (RBL) broke
OL,7,Fits fundraising record for London Poppy
OL,8,FDay after raising more than #1.7m in
OL,9,Fone day of donations being collected
OL,10,Facross the capital.
OL,12,FOn 29 October, the charity marked the
OL,13,F20th anniversary of its annual
OL,14,Ffundraising event in the capital for
OL,15,Fthe armed forces community and included
OL,16,Fperformances from military bands and
OL,17,Fchoirs at more than 20 stations
OL,18,Fincluding Waterloo, Liverpool Street,
OL,19,FEuston and London Bridge.
OL,21,FIn 2025, the event raised almost #1.5m
OL,22,Ffor the RBL.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
