OL,3,GNEWSALondon Poppy Day breaks
OL,4,Afundraising record
OL,5,
OL,6,FTamsin Fraser, head of the Poppy
OL,7,FAppeal, said that 12 hours of
OL,8,Ffundraising in the capital had raised
OL,9,Fan "incredible sum", adding: "Everyone
OL,10,Fcame out in force for us."
